+render_markdown: true  # whether a markdown file opens rendered, as VS Code's markdown preview, in a worktree `lym ide` seeds; lym then owns the "*.md" entry of workbench.editorAssociations in the worktree's settings.json, and off removes that entry while it names the preview; "Reopen Editor With..." switches one file either way
